      "Save C at ABF8; independently paired-read ABF8, zero-extend low selector; fresh AAB0[selector] becomes zeroextended BC; fresh A609[index] becomes A. Exact DAD CY and preserved NZPA, HL=A609+index. Already UNDERSTOOD in prior archaeology; no new byte promotion."
